      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat is compliant with the GDPR and other applicable data privacy statutes. The VRChat Privacy Policy, available at https://hello.vrchat.com/privacy, instructs users on how to submit requests regarding their personal information. Specifically, Section Section 5(B) of the Privacy Policy references the the right to access and receive a copy of personal information pursuant to GDPR Art. 15. We regularly receive and process these requests from users within the deadlines set forth in the GDPR.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
