      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{60651324fbe2815d2b9ff6cb|full_name}: We disagree that we are or have been out of compliance with the GDPR. Users have not previously expressed that they had difficulties submitting requests concerning their personal information. In fact, we regularly receive and process such requests.\n\nHowever, in order to add further clarity to the process, we just added the support category for \"I want to make a request concerning my personal information\" as part of our standard support form.",
